// A built-in the compiler has no synthesis recipe for cannot be derived bare (E0014). The refusal
// is about the recipe and not about `@derive`, so each shape's help names the route that is still
// open: `Add` has a `via:` template (delegate through a field), `Validate` has none and wants an
// `impl`. Both are pinned here because that difference is the whole diagnostic.
// expect: error E0014 at 8:9
// expect: error E0014 at 11:9
// expect: exit 1
@derive(Validate)
struct Reading { v: int }

@derive(Add)
struct Tally { v: int }

echo "unreached"
